<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Carriers of this gene need to be affected by pollution on a regular basis to survive. After 5 days without pollution, carriers will suffer from pollution deficiency. After 30 days, they will fall into a coma. After 60 days, they will die.-->
  <VRE_Pollution.description>这种基因的携带者需要定期受到污染的影响才能生存。 5天无污染后，载体将出现污染缺陷。 30天后，他们将陷入昏迷。 60天后，他们就会死去。</VRE_Pollution.description>
  <!--EN: pollution-->
  <VRE_Pollution.label>污染</VRE_Pollution.label>
</LanguageData>
